  "historical_output_text": " From: Alex Turner To: Department Team Date 15th June CC to HR Dept Subject line - Clarifiy on Routine Expense Claims process \n\n---\n\nSubject of the message\n\n---\n\nGood Day,\n\nWe wanted to briefly outline the updated process regarding how our company manages routine financial expense submissions.\n\nUpon the submission or approval by a direct line of management of your claims for regular expenses like office purchases (paper etc.), they would then move forward for review in HR.\n\nThis ensures our processes stay compliant. In cases of unusual spending or significant amounts we may ask that an explanation of expenditure or additional details to be submitted as an extra check before we final the claim in finance for processing payment. Please note all expense reports should contain adequate documentation for any expenses.\n\nIn light, we invite you should have a further any further questions about our expense management system or need clarification to",
